### IntentFlow Shop API — run with the IntelliJ / VS Code REST client.
### Start the app first: gradle :intentflow-examples:bootTestRun
@base = http://localhost:8080

### --- AI search -------------------------------------------------------------

### Simple filter
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=apple laptops under 2000

### Sorting + limit
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=top 5 best rated headphones

### Routes to another service
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=vip customers from germany or france

### Dates relative to today
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=orders placed in the last 3 months, newest first

### Scoped search: only products are offered to the LLM, response items are Product JSON
GET {{base}}/api/products/search?q=samsung phones under 1000 dollars

### Scoped search on orders
GET {{base}}/api/orders/search?q=cancelled orders this year

### Nothing matches -> 200 with empty rows, uri points at the collection
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=products that cost more than 100000 dollars

### Hidden field -> 422 "Can't answer that"
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=products sorted by supplier cost

### Blank query -> 400
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=

### --- Products ---------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{base}}/api/products?page=0&size=10

###
GET {{base}}/api/products/1

###
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Galaxy Z Fold 7",
  "brand": "Samsung",
  "category": "PHONE",
  "price": 1999.00,
  "rating": 4.4,
  "stock": 12,
  "active": true,
  "supplierCost": 1400.00
}

### Validation error -> 400 with per-field errors
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "brand": "Acme",
  "category": "TOASTER",
  "price": -1,
  "rating": 7,
  "stock": -3,
  "active": true,
  "supplierCost": 1
}

###
PUT {{base}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "MacBook Air 13 M3",
  "brand": "Apple",
  "category": "LAPTOP",
  "price": 999.00,
  "rating": 4.8,
  "stock": 140,
  "active": true,
  "supplierCost": 865.83
}

###
DELETE {{base}}/api/products/40

### --- Customers --------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{base}}/api/customers

###
POST {{base}}/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ada Lovelace", "email": "ada@example.com", "city": "London", "country": "gb", "vip": true }

### --- Orders -----------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{base}}/api/orders?page=0&size=20

###
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 1, "status": "NEW", "total": 249.00, "itemsCount": 1 }

### Unknown customer -> 404
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": 9999, "status": "NEW", "total": 10.00, "itemsCount": 1 }

### --- Relations, totals and debugging ----------------------------------------

GET {{base}}/api/search?q=delivered orders from customers in Germany

###
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=how many orders are there per status?

###
GET {{base}}/api/products/search?q=average price of phones

###
GET {{base}}/api/search?q=vip customers with a cancelled order&debug=true
